                                                            "choices": [
                                                              {
                                                                "continue": true,
                                                                "dialogNode": {
                                                                  "characterRef": "char_1792138742562_zqrq6cn6f",
                                                                  "choices": [],
                                                                  "id": "node_1792429556955",
                                                                  "speaker": "Vic",
                                                                  "text": "Thank you!"
                                                                },
                                                                "id": "continue_1792429556955",
                                                                "text": ""
                                                              }
                                                            ],
                                                            "id": "node_1792429320224",
                                                            "speaker": "Stan",
                                                            "text": "Vic I apologize. I should have stopped Billie when she was mocking Tim and I should have stopped her when she was harassing you. I thought it was just jokes and you were ok with it. I didn't notice she was hurting you, even though deep down I knew what she was doing. I should not have been helping her by looking the other way. But those excuses are not acceptable. So, I'm truly sorry Vic. "
                                                          },
                                                          "id": "continue_1792429320224",
                                                          "text": ""
                                                        }
                                                      ],
                                                      "id": "node_1792429236326",
                                                      "speaker": "Stan",
                                                      "text": " It could be.  If I can't stop it, then I could at least try to reach someone who can.\n\nThat's why I have to apologize. I'm not apologizing for her. She should do it herself.\n"
                                                    },
                                                    "id": "continue_1792429236326",
                                                    "text": ""
                                                  }
                                                ],
                                                "id": "node_1792429223149",
                                                "speaker": "Vic",
                                                "text": "Isn't that dangerous? Stopping crimes."
                                              },
                                              "id": "continue_1792429223149",
                                              "text": ""
                                            }
                                          ],
                                          "id": "node_1792429066677",
                                          "speaker": "Stan",
                                          "text": "I don't know if I could stop it but I could at least try! My parents taught me that if someone does not try to stop a crime they see, they are guilty, too.\n"
                                        },
                                        "id": "continue_1792429066677",
                                        "text": ""
                                      }
                                    ],
                                    "id": "node_1792429024465",
                                    "speaker": "Vic",
                                    "text": "To me? Why would you need that?"
                                  },
                                  "id": "continue_1792429024465",
                                  "text": ""
                                }
                              ],
                              "id": "node_1792428976981",
                              "speaker": "Stan",
                              "text": "Me. I need to apologize to you...and to Tim.\n"
                            },
                            "id": "continue_1792428976981",
                            "text": ""
                          }
                        ],
                        "id": "node_1792428883775",
                        "speaker": "Vic",
                        "text": "What do you mean? Who needs to apologize?"
                      },
                      "id": "continue_1792428883775",
                      "text": ""
                    }
                  ],
                  "id": "node_1792428812955",
                  "speaker": "Stan",
                  "text": " That's not true, besides I should've done that earlier. Then maybe Tim wouldn't have to change schools.\n\nSpeaking of that, an apology is in order.\n"
                },
                "id": "continue_1792428812955",
                "text": ""
              }
            ],
            "id": "node_1792428724182",
            "speaker": "Vic",
            "speakerState": "state_1792415304558",
            "text": " I’m fine. \nWhy did you do that? I thought you didn't really care about me?\n"
          },
          "id": "continue_1792428724182",
          "text": ""
        }
      ],
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "id": "root",
      "speaker": "Stan",
      "text": "How do you feel?"
    },
